# Build and test outputs.
# /dist/ holds the release artifacts from `make dist` / `make smoke-dist`; /aimesh is what
# `go build ./cmd/aimesh` leaves at the repo root; *.test is `go test -c`; *.out is a coverage profile.
/dist/
/aimesh
/aimesh.exe
*.exe
*.test
*.out
*.prof

# go.work IS tracked here: the workspace is the build (see CONTRIBUTING.md), so the usual
# Go-template rule that ignores it does not apply.

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Personal tooling (editor, agent and local-state directories) is NOT listed here on purpose:
# it belongs in each contributor's global gitignore or in .git/info/exclude.
